@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89346
+notes:
+  mod_assign:
+    - message: >-
+        The external function `mod_assign_get_submission_status` now returns
+        the feedback given by each individual marker (when using multiple
+        marking) in the new optional `markers` field of the `feedback` and
+        `previousattempts` structures.
+      type: changed
+    - message: >-
+        New methods `assign_feedback_plugin::get_marker_file_areas()` and
+        `assign_feedback_plugin::get_overall_file_areas()` have been added, so
+        feedback plugins can declare which file areas store the feedback of
+        individual markers (using the mark id as item id).
+      type: improved
